abstract: "A desktop GUI application for interactive signal preprocessing and multi-Gaussian deconvolution. Supports CSV data loading, baseline correction, noise filtering (Savitzky-Golay and Fourier Transform), and automated peak fitting using differential evolution optimization. Includes batch processing and export capabilities."
